    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        " **We will also fix the inaccurate AI Detector; ResNet50 was definitely not a good model to choose since it was not trained to analyze *how* an image was made.**\n",
        "\n",
        "Let us install a better \"Detector\" library!\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "**We shall incorporate choice 1, the image plagiarism detector, as well.**"
      ],
